  "resume": "This document is a parliamentary record of a motion by Didier Berberat concerning the suspension of compulsory insurance during military conscription, debated in the Council of States on 14 June 2005. The record includes speakers Rolf Büttiker and Alex Kuprecht and is part of the Swiss Federal Archives' holdings of the Council of States' meeting protocols. It captures a legislative discussion on social policy within the Swiss federal parliamentary process."
 },
